WEBVTT

00:01.600 --> 00:03.670
The Girl of White...

00:03.670 --> 00:06.900
...had a very beautiful, good heart.

00:08.400 --> 00:11.340
On the other hand, the Girl of Black...

00:11.340 --> 00:14.830
...had a very unsightly, evil heart.

00:18.210 --> 00:20.280
The Girl of Black...

00:20.280 --> 00:26.190
...envied and hated the ever happy and smiling Girl of White...

00:26.190 --> 00:30.630
...and thought of erasing her very existence.

00:33.960 --> 00:35.030
You...

00:35.030 --> 00:36.690
...were listening...

00:38.530 --> 00:40.300
Truth is...

00:42.970 --> 00:45.810
...the two girls...

00:45.810 --> 00:48.810
...were originally from one girl...

00:48.810 --> 00:49.940
Huh...?

00:50.980 --> 00:52.310
Now go...

00:52.310 --> 00:54.580
...to their world.

01:40.600 --> 01:42.100
<i>Taken and granted,</i>

01:42.100 --> 01:46.100
<i>ideals are repetitious games that slip through</i>

01:46.100 --> 01:48.800
<i>My daily life is so shot with holes</i>

01:48.800 --> 01:51.640
<i>that I can barely stand</i>

01:51.640 --> 01:52.970
<i>Empty theories without conclusions</i>

01:52.970 --> 01:57.150
<i>Dance steps along invisible rules</i>

01:57.150 --> 02:02.280
<i>The final bell holding together</i> <i>the crumbling day rings</i>

02:02.280 --> 02:06.690
<i>In the scene I imagine</i>

02:06.690 --> 02:09.320
<i>you're there</i>

02:09.320 --> 02:12.160
<i>with a smile</i>

02:12.160 --> 02:17.670
<i>No forgiveness? No desires?</i>

02:17.670 --> 02:21.070
<i>And still</i>

02:22.700 --> 02:25.910
<i>We cry "OPEN"</i>

02:25.910 --> 02:30.210
<i>A future to get back and a world to destroy</i>

02:30.210 --> 02:32.680
<i>A wish to open. GOT IT?</i>

02:32.680 --> 02:34.350
<i>Now cross</i>

02:34.350 --> 02:37.020
<i>I wish you don't cry</i>

02:37.020 --> 02:44.030
<i>The future of light and dark,</i> <i>let's believe in the "future"</i>

02:44.030 --> 02:50.520
<i>so that they overlap to gain color again</i>

02:58.870 --> 03:00.940
All right, nice work!

03:00.940 --> 03:03.740
Iona, Akira, you both did well.

03:07.520 --> 03:10.080
Come to the dressing room later.

03:10.080 --> 03:10.590
Urith...!

03:10.590 --> 03:14.420
No. There are people here.

03:14.420 --> 03:15.720
I'm sorry...

03:15.720 --> 03:18.860
That's... for when we're alone.

03:18.860 --> 03:21.350
--I'll be waiting.
--Okay!

03:25.400 --> 03:27.200
Iona...

03:27.200 --> 03:29.570
Just you wait...

03:29.570 --> 03:33.060
Iona-<i>san</i> is... the Girl of Black?

03:34.740 --> 03:37.580
Iona-<i>san</i>, is that true?

03:37.580 --> 03:41.150
What's... happening to me?

03:41.150 --> 03:44.250
W-Well, what happened to Futase-<i>san</i>?

03:44.250 --> 03:46.550
That's about all I know.

03:46.550 --> 03:48.590
I see...

03:48.590 --> 03:50.460
This is confusing...

03:50.460 --> 03:53.760
If Iona is this "Girl of Black"...

03:53.760 --> 03:56.560
...what does it have to do with Selector battles?

03:56.560 --> 03:59.800
And, about the Girl of White...

03:59.800 --> 04:01.390
White...

04:03.140 --> 04:04.070
Ruko?

04:04.070 --> 04:05.270
Huh, what...?

04:05.270 --> 04:09.840
Mayu-<i>kun</i>'s conversation only lasted a short moment.

04:09.840 --> 04:11.410
Urr...

04:11.410 --> 04:14.080
--Chiyori-<i>chan</i>?
--If you have to use the toilet, just go.

04:14.080 --> 04:15.620
Urrroooh!

04:15.620 --> 04:16.750
--Wha-?!
--Wh-What?!

04:16.750 --> 04:19.250
The excitement is over the top!

04:19.250 --> 04:21.260
Ah, she has spasms like this time-to-time,

04:21.260 --> 04:24.630
so don't let it bother you folks, and continue your talk.

04:24.630 --> 04:28.760
So, the WIXOSS novel was born from the oath between

04:28.760 --> 04:32.270
Futase-<i>sensei</i> and Fumio-<i>san</i>'s passionate friendship?

04:32.270 --> 04:33.930
Friendship?

04:35.340 --> 04:37.810
It was first an Internet novel, right?

04:37.810 --> 04:39.510
Yes...

04:38.440 --> 04:41.710
"Work Writing Stories"

04:39.510 --> 04:42.340
After searching for ways to become a novelist...

04:42.340 --> 04:46.210
...I found out that such an approach was now possible.

04:44.980 --> 04:51.050
"Thread to talk about Futase Fumio."

04:44.980 --> 04:51.050
"A pretty awesome newcomer named

04:44.980 --> 04:51.050
[Futase Fumio] appeared recently!!"

04:51.050 --> 04:53.390
"Do you know Futase Fumio?"

04:51.050 --> 04:53.390
"Sure do."

04:51.050 --> 04:53.390
"Heard the writing's good."

04:53.390 --> 04:55.380
"Everyone's Ranking"

04:53.390 --> 04:55.380
"Web Novel Ranking"

04:53.390 --> 04:55.380
"Author: Futase Fumio"

04:53.390 --> 04:55.380
"Wish-That Card to Eternity and Beyond"

05:01.360 --> 05:04.870
I didn't expect it to turn out this well...

05:02.360 --> 05:05.200
"...In short, we would like to discuss

05:02.360 --> 05:05.200
the prospect of publishing your work."

05:05.670 --> 05:07.640
You're amazing, Sensei!

05:07.640 --> 05:10.000
All of Chiyori is wailing over your happy ending!

05:10.000 --> 05:12.870
You're such a dummy!
What's so "happy" about it?!

05:12.870 --> 05:16.310
What happened to the Fumio-<i>san</i> who became an LRIG?

05:16.310 --> 05:18.710
Apparently, no one knows.

05:18.710 --> 05:21.350
Futase-<i>san</i> returning from being an LRIG to human,

05:21.350 --> 05:24.690
only to be participating in battles as a Selector is...

05:24.690 --> 05:25.720
Is just...

05:25.720 --> 05:27.220
Wait.

05:27.220 --> 05:31.360
Wasn't the wish to become a novelist realized already?

05:31.360 --> 05:35.830
Isn't it strange to become a
Selector again for that wish?

05:35.830 --> 05:38.270
That is a strange thing for you to say as well.

05:38.270 --> 05:39.100
About what?

05:39.100 --> 05:42.900
You being an LRIG must mean you were once a Selector.

05:42.900 --> 05:45.410
You had a wish you wanted to realize...

05:45.410 --> 05:49.280
...and thus you believed the sweet words of your LRIG...

05:49.280 --> 05:51.450
...winning to become an Eternal Girl.

05:51.450 --> 05:56.020
Hanayo-<i>san</i> wasn't willfully trying to deceive me.

05:56.020 --> 05:58.620
She always worried for me.

05:58.620 --> 06:01.520
I'm sure... even now...

06:03.960 --> 06:09.200
Is your wish something that would satisfy you if it came true only for a short time?

06:09.200 --> 06:10.200
Well...

06:10.200 --> 06:15.900
Wasn't your wish something that made sense only when it went beyond the moment, forever?

06:16.940 --> 06:20.900
It... was a wish I wanted to last forever.

06:22.280 --> 06:24.040
How about you?

06:25.980 --> 06:27.550
Fumio...

06:27.550 --> 06:29.920
Her wish is the same.

06:29.920 --> 06:35.390
To become a novelist meant that she wanted to live as a novelist...

06:35.390 --> 06:40.960
Writing only two volumes doesn't give me the right to call myself a novelist yet.

06:40.960 --> 06:45.770
I'm merely an ephemeral hollow of an existence that would fade once the writing stops.

06:45.770 --> 06:51.070
A wish... truly begins when one believes that it was fulfilled.

06:51.070 --> 06:54.780
It can't be realized until it is fulfilled until death.

06:54.780 --> 06:58.110
There's... no end to it.

06:58.110 --> 07:02.620
Unlike Fumio, I haven't read many books.

07:02.620 --> 07:06.090
The only reason I could somehow write the novel...

07:06.090 --> 07:11.190
...was because, as a Selector,
I had first-hand knowledge of LRIGs.

07:11.190 --> 07:14.930
But soon the well of knowledge dries.

07:14.930 --> 07:18.330
I see. So that's why she's having writer's block.

07:18.330 --> 07:23.540
But, but, the power of friendship from the passionate oath will save Futase-<i>sensei</i> from--

07:23.540 --> 07:26.010
Reality isn't like stories!

07:27.780 --> 07:31.710
Friendship and oaths don't help at all!

07:31.710 --> 07:33.820
B-But, Sensei can...

07:33.820 --> 07:35.880
I can't write even if I wanted to!

07:35.880 --> 07:38.550
And yet, I can't stop writing!

07:38.550 --> 07:44.130
Is what binds me, a mission or my promise to her?

07:44.130 --> 07:46.460
I can't even tell now...

07:46.460 --> 07:49.060
...after living my life as Futase Fumio.

07:49.060 --> 07:51.230
Who am I?

07:51.230 --> 07:54.840
By the looks of it, rather than being an Eternal Girl's wish...

07:54.840 --> 07:57.510
...it's more fitting to call it a curse, right?

07:57.510 --> 07:59.840
A curse where you're crushed by another's wish,

07:59.840 --> 08:05.050
and you live as another, only to lose sight of who you once were.

08:05.050 --> 08:08.220
I'm going to go to the white window room again.

08:08.220 --> 08:09.220
Mayu...

08:09.220 --> 08:13.050
If I don't meet her, the story can't continue...!

08:13.050 --> 08:15.720
Now, are you my next opponent?

08:15.720 --> 08:17.560
Or is it you?!

08:17.560 --> 08:20.390
Which one of you will battle me?

08:23.000 --> 08:26.500
Chiyori-<i>chan</i> and I won't battle!

08:26.500 --> 08:29.770
Oh... So I guess that's it then...

08:29.770 --> 08:31.610
That's right...

08:31.610 --> 08:35.580
I can write a new chapter because of you girls.

08:35.580 --> 08:39.170
I need to write... I need to write...

08:40.410 --> 08:42.420
Do you see?

08:42.420 --> 08:47.620
You may be asserting something right, just like a heroine from a novel.

08:47.620 --> 08:49.420
--That's not what I--
--But...

08:49.420 --> 08:52.430
...some need to rely on Selector battles.

08:52.430 --> 08:54.730
Just like Futase...

08:54.730 --> 08:56.300
I need to go...

08:56.300 --> 08:57.800
White room...

08:57.800 --> 08:59.570
Large window...

08:59.570 --> 09:01.400
To Mayu-<i>kun...</i>

09:01.400 --> 09:03.070
I need to go...

09:03.070 --> 09:04.560
White room...

09:05.940 --> 09:08.430
Don't let it bother you.

09:09.640 --> 09:10.940
Sure...

09:17.590 --> 09:19.140
Chiyori-<i>chan</i>?!

09:20.660 --> 09:25.390
It must've been shocking, especially with how Chiyori admired the novel.

09:25.390 --> 09:27.130
Are you okay, Yuzuki?

09:27.130 --> 09:30.400
Ahh... Honestly, it was a bit too much.

09:30.400 --> 09:36.100
Especially when I think of how Hanayo-<i>san</i> may be suffering because of my wish.

09:36.100 --> 09:40.410
Even if LRIGs become human again, this is too painful to bear.

09:40.410 --> 09:44.480
That's why we need to stop Selector battles.

09:44.480 --> 09:51.250
I... thought that if all the battles went away, no one would need to experience sorrow.

09:51.250 --> 09:52.120
Ruko...

09:52.120 --> 09:53.250
But...

09:53.250 --> 09:57.690
...there are others who need it, even when they know the truth.

09:57.690 --> 10:00.290
Her situation is different!

10:00.290 --> 10:03.930
When I saw Akira-<i>san</i> before, she was saying...

10:03.930 --> 10:07.300
...that battling would help her be her best again.

10:07.300 --> 10:11.510
We were able to meet because... we were Selectors, right?

10:11.510 --> 10:13.310
Hey! You too, Hitoe?!

10:13.310 --> 10:15.800
That's why I...

10:16.880 --> 10:20.880
...still want to release all the girls who became LRIGs!

10:20.880 --> 10:25.890
I don't want anyone to suffer after becoming an Eternal Girl.

10:25.890 --> 10:27.190
Ru--

10:27.190 --> 10:28.620
Ruko...

10:31.560 --> 10:38.300
If there's a way to return Futase-<i>san</i> back to her normal self, then I want to look for that, too.

10:38.300 --> 10:40.500
Earlier, Iona-<i>san...</i>

10:40.500 --> 10:47.210
If you want to save everyone, don't let needless things sway you, and show your true self!

10:47.210 --> 10:50.750
...reminded me of what's important.

10:50.750 --> 10:55.480
Iona-<i>san</i>, thank you for your help in battle.

10:58.050 --> 11:01.020
Iona-<i>san</i>? What's the matter?!

11:09.100 --> 11:11.360
Such a good girl...

11:12.370 --> 11:14.870
It is Urith's request after all...

11:14.870 --> 11:17.270
Oh...?

11:16.740 --> 11:18.370
"Aki-lovely's Group"

11:16.740 --> 11:18.370
"Was that thing about a [special LRIG] serious?"

11:16.740 --> 11:18.370
"...a girl I know changed suddenly!"

11:17.270 --> 11:19.010
I'm so happy...

11:18.370 --> 11:19.670
"What happens if you have one?"

11:18.370 --> 11:19.670
"So that's what the girls have

11:18.370 --> 11:19.670
been making a fuss about?"

11:20.010 --> 11:23.610
I actually had another favor to ask.

11:23.610 --> 11:25.250
What? I'll do anything!

11:25.250 --> 11:26.550
Anything!

11:26.550 --> 11:29.240
It's something I can only ask from you, Akira.

11:39.090 --> 11:42.200
Sure, okay.

11:42.200 --> 11:46.600
But, she's probably going to say she doesn't want to battle.

11:46.600 --> 11:50.710
What is her most precious thing?

11:50.710 --> 11:53.540
You take it from there.

11:53.540 --> 11:56.270
I'm looking forward to an interesting show...

11:57.410 --> 12:00.710
Don't let me down.

12:05.390 --> 12:07.150
I'm home, grandma!

12:07.150 --> 12:08.820
Yes, welcome home.

12:08.820 --> 12:11.330
E-Excuse me!

12:11.330 --> 12:13.890
Yes, welcome.

12:16.830 --> 12:19.320
Girl of Black...

12:22.170 --> 12:24.570
Girl of Dark...

12:29.010 --> 12:30.680
I'm...

12:30.680 --> 12:33.180
You're the Girl of Black.

12:33.180 --> 12:35.520
The Girl of Black?

12:35.520 --> 12:39.350
You envy everyone, and bring sorrow to everyone...

12:39.350 --> 12:43.960
You're hated by everyone, and you hate everyone...

12:43.960 --> 12:47.190
You're such a bad girl...

12:47.190 --> 12:49.260
A girl who's all alone.

12:49.260 --> 12:50.630
No...

12:50.630 --> 12:52.200
That's not me...

12:52.200 --> 12:55.200
Ah, hate, hate, hate...

12:55.200 --> 12:56.800
You hate everyone.

12:56.800 --> 12:59.510
The Girl of Black brings misery to all.

12:59.510 --> 13:02.170
No... No, no...!

13:03.640 --> 13:07.520
Battling for eternity to bring misery to all...

13:07.520 --> 13:09.820
Such is the fate of the Girl of Black.

13:09.820 --> 13:11.480
No...!

13:13.520 --> 13:14.990
No...

13:17.630 --> 13:19.690
What should I do...?
Did she catch a cold?

13:19.690 --> 13:21.960
--How about medicine?
--Let me go get it!

13:21.960 --> 13:25.200
Hold it! How are you going to make her take it?

13:25.200 --> 13:26.570
Oh, that's right...

13:26.570 --> 13:30.560
I haven't caught a cold or anything since becoming an LRIG...

13:31.870 --> 13:33.170
Iona-<i>san...</i>

13:33.170 --> 13:36.880
Can you tell if you're cold or have a fever? Iona-<i>san...</i>

13:36.880 --> 13:38.510
Does your stomach hurt?

13:38.510 --> 13:40.580
Why... is she...

13:40.580 --> 13:43.680
If there's anything I can do, please tell me.

13:43.680 --> 13:46.420
...so concerned like that for me?

13:46.420 --> 13:48.420
I'll be beside you.

13:48.420 --> 13:50.020
But...

13:50.020 --> 13:52.090
...that's why...

13:52.090 --> 13:55.260
...I feel a little... cold...

13:57.200 --> 13:59.400
Isn't it painful?

13:59.400 --> 14:01.530
Doesn't it hurt?

14:02.540 --> 14:07.340
You're of black, and you hate white things.

14:07.340 --> 14:09.040
Longing for white...

14:09.040 --> 14:12.510
...and wishing to be next to white...

14:12.510 --> 14:14.350
...will just...

14:14.350 --> 14:17.220
...make the pain worse.

14:23.690 --> 14:25.360
Looks like she's calmed a bit.

14:25.360 --> 14:26.260
Yup.

14:26.260 --> 14:27.960
You know...

14:27.960 --> 14:30.460
...about Iona being the "Girl of Black"...

14:30.460 --> 14:31.430
That means...

14:31.430 --> 14:32.370
Yup...

14:32.370 --> 14:36.300
Iona-<i>san</i>... must know something.

14:36.300 --> 14:39.040
Let's press for answers when she's back to health.

14:39.040 --> 14:43.540
If we became friends... would Iona-<i>san</i> open up to us more?

14:43.540 --> 14:44.580
Ruko?

14:44.580 --> 14:49.220
She's keeping secrets because of reasons she doesn't want to tell us, right?

14:49.220 --> 14:50.220
I●●●

14:50.220 --> 14:52.150
...had things...

14:52.150 --> 14:54.960
...I couldn't say to Tama, either.

14:54.960 --> 15:01.000
I only thought of my own feelings, and didn't think about how Tama felt.

15:01.000 --> 15:03.400
I hurt her with that...

15:03.400 --> 15:05.570
This time I want to do things right.

15:05.570 --> 15:08.670
I want to start over again...

15:08.670 --> 15:10.300
You're such a softie, Ruko!

15:10.300 --> 15:12.010
Wh-What?

15:12.010 --> 15:16.500
You're making me sound bad for talking about pressing answers from her. Hmph!

15:20.450 --> 15:23.820
Let's all start over, together.

15:23.820 --> 15:26.590
In a way where no one needs to sacrifice themselves.

15:26.590 --> 15:27.860
Yeah.

15:27.860 --> 15:29.190
Yup.

15:31.030 --> 15:32.830
Ru-<i>chan</i>?

15:32.830 --> 15:37.200
Don't you think Hitoe-<i>chan</i>'s family is getting worried?

15:37.200 --> 15:39.370
Ah, look at the time!

15:39.370 --> 15:40.630
Sorry, but I have to go.

15:40.630 --> 15:41.700
Hitoe.

15:41.700 --> 15:44.330
Can I... stay?

15:45.670 --> 15:48.300
Yup. Please do.

15:49.840 --> 15:54.010
I wish I could stay too, but mom would get worried.

15:54.010 --> 15:57.140
Both of you, thanks.

15:58.390 --> 15:59.950
I'm fine here.

15:59.950 --> 16:01.660
You have Iona-<i>san</i> to care for.

16:01.660 --> 16:04.020
Okay, be careful.

16:07.160 --> 16:09.530
I'll call you when I get home.

16:18.970 --> 16:21.370
I better hurry home.

16:22.640 --> 16:24.040
That took too long...

16:24.040 --> 16:26.380
I was getting tired of all this waiting.

16:26.380 --> 16:28.550
A-Akira-<i>san...</i>

16:28.550 --> 16:31.050
Hitoe, let's battle!

16:31.050 --> 16:31.890
Huh?

16:31.890 --> 16:36.390
We haven't done it since we got new LRIGs, right?

16:36.390 --> 16:37.390
I don't want to.

16:37.390 --> 16:40.730
Are you scared of losing again?

16:40.730 --> 16:42.700
C'mon, don't worry!

16:42.700 --> 16:44.230
I'll●●●

16:44.230 --> 16:47.770
...just hurt you even more than before...

16:47.770 --> 16:49.100
I won't battle!

16:49.100 --> 16:50.070
Aww...

16:50.070 --> 16:54.910
If Hitoe isn't gonna battle me,
I guess I'll go to Ru-ru's place!

16:54.910 --> 16:57.750
Don't get involved with Ruko anymore!

16:57.750 --> 16:59.880
Huh?

16:59.880 --> 17:01.780
The heck is with you ordering me around?

17:01.780 --> 17:06.890
I won't let anyone trying to hurt Ruko get away!

17:06.890 --> 17:08.590
You piss me off...

17:08.590 --> 17:09.760
You seriously piss me off!

17:09.760 --> 17:13.460
Don't push your luck, you lame nobody!

17:13.460 --> 17:17.100
I decided... to start over with everyone!

17:17.100 --> 17:20.970
Well then, battle me...

17:20.970 --> 17:24.130
Show me how you're not gonna let me go!

17:26.410 --> 17:29.880
Looks like she doesn't have her LRIG-lun!

17:29.880 --> 17:30.580
Huh?!

17:30.580 --> 17:32.250
I don't sense one around-lun.

17:32.250 --> 17:34.550
What the hell?!

17:34.550 --> 17:37.420
Well, looks like you can only play a normal game of WIXOSS!

17:37.420 --> 17:39.120
Shut up!

17:39.120 --> 17:40.450
Damn it...

17:40.450 --> 17:42.590
Damn it...!

17:42.590 --> 17:46.990
This is going to mess with Urith's request...

17:46.990 --> 17:48.560
She's going to be let down...

17:48.560 --> 17:50.400
No... I can't...!

17:50.400 --> 17:52.230
Urith is going to hate me...!

17:52.230 --> 17:53.430
No way!

17:53.430 --> 17:54.570
Wh-What...?

17:54.570 --> 17:55.940
Dump me.

17:55.940 --> 17:57.440
She's going to dump me...

17:57.440 --> 17:59.340
No... No...!

17:59.340 --> 18:00.410
What should I do...?

18:00.410 --> 18:02.910
Sorry... I'm sorry...!

18:02.910 --> 18:05.280
You take it from there.

18:05.280 --> 18:08.580
I'm looking forward to an interesting show...

18:08.580 --> 18:09.820
Akira-<i>san</i>...?

18:09.820 --> 18:12.250
Ahh...

18:12.250 --> 18:13.920
As long as you're around...

18:13.920 --> 18:16.080
...everything's gonna be okay!

18:28.040 --> 18:29.440
Rain...?

18:29.440 --> 18:31.370
The rain's gotten stronger.

18:31.370 --> 18:34.170
I hope Hitoe isn't getting drenched.

18:34.170 --> 18:36.610
Warm...

18:36.610 --> 18:38.880
Iona!

18:38.880 --> 18:42.720
Do you remember?
You were in pain all of a sudden...

18:42.720 --> 18:44.380
I'll be beside you.

18:44.380 --> 18:47.220
It... wasn't a dream?

18:47.220 --> 18:49.960
Are you okay now?

18:49.960 --> 18:51.060
Yes...

18:51.060 --> 18:53.330
Thank goodness...

18:53.330 --> 18:54.900
Ah, this is...

18:54.900 --> 18:57.830
Well, you did say you were cold, so...

18:57.830 --> 19:01.230
Doing this is of no use to an LRIG like me...

19:02.240 --> 19:03.840
Maybe it's Hitoe!

19:03.840 --> 19:07.240
Um, grandma, I'll get it!

19:11.210 --> 19:13.550
Hitoe, did the rain get you?

19:13.550 --> 19:17.810
Hitoe wouldn't cooperate, so she's all wet.

19:20.220 --> 19:21.560
Akira-<i>san</i>...?

19:21.090 --> 19:22.920
"Create"

19:21.090 --> 19:22.920
"Urith"

19:21.090 --> 19:22.920
"I got her"

19:21.560 --> 19:23.390
Correct!

19:23.390 --> 19:26.030
That's my Ru-ru! So Aki-lovely!

19:26.030 --> 19:27.490
Where's Hitoe?

19:27.490 --> 19:30.190
I'm gonna tell you where you need to come.

19:32.370 --> 19:34.570
Yup... Yup, okay.

19:34.570 --> 19:35.370
No, Ruko!

19:35.370 --> 19:37.910
--Hitoe?!
--Shut up, ugly!

19:37.910 --> 19:41.540
I got it! I'll go, so please stop hurting Hitoe!

19:41.540 --> 19:43.710
Bring Iona with you too.

19:43.710 --> 19:48.020
Selectors and LRIGs have to be buddy-buddy and be together, you know?

19:48.020 --> 19:49.680
Wait... Iona isn't...

19:49.680 --> 19:51.780
You're coming now!

19:57.220 --> 19:59.530
How's Hitoe?

19:59.530 --> 20:01.050
Ruko?

20:02.900 --> 20:05.600
Akira-<i>san</i> has Hitoe...

20:05.600 --> 20:08.740
She said to come now with Iona...

20:08.740 --> 20:10.970
Fine. Take me with you.

20:10.970 --> 20:12.040
But...

20:12.040 --> 20:14.370
You're not letting this go, right?

20:15.410 --> 20:18.080
I'm fine already.

20:18.080 --> 20:20.550
Iona... I'm sorry...

20:20.550 --> 20:21.570
Thanks!

20:28.260 --> 20:29.590
Ruko!

20:40.730 --> 20:42.170
Hitoe!

20:47.740 --> 20:49.010
That's horrible...

20:49.010 --> 20:51.080
Totally horrible, right?

20:51.080 --> 20:53.750
Look at this bite mark.

20:53.750 --> 20:56.320
Now what am I going to do at the next shoot?

20:56.320 --> 20:58.920
You're the one who started it!

20:58.920 --> 21:02.520
It's your fault for not being next to her as her freaking LRIG!

21:02.520 --> 21:05.010
And, where's Iona?

21:06.830 --> 21:08.930
Handling things like usual, it seems.

21:08.930 --> 21:13.700
I wish you could've seen Hitoe getting all desperate and stuff.

21:13.700 --> 21:15.870
Like, she was saying she was going to protect Ru-ru...

21:15.870 --> 21:17.970
Acting all cocky to me!

21:17.970 --> 21:18.870
Hitoe!

21:18.870 --> 21:23.040
Hey, once a nobody, always a nobody.

21:23.040 --> 21:26.310
If you want to battle me that much, I'll battle you...!

21:26.310 --> 21:27.210
Ruko!

21:27.210 --> 21:30.650
But in return, I never want you to do anything like this again!

21:30.650 --> 21:34.610
Oops! Looks like you're missing the point.

21:36.490 --> 21:38.190
She's here!

21:38.190 --> 21:40.290
She came!

21:45.330 --> 21:48.790
I'm not part of the fun, am I?

21:51.240 --> 21:52.670
Urith...

21:52.510 --> 21:55.940
"That Existence is Dark Black"

22:02.350 --> 22:03.820
<i>Life...</i>

22:03.820 --> 22:09.220
<i>A city of mazes with no exit</i>

22:09.220 --> 22:13.830
<i>and the sound of bells ringing</i>

22:13.830 --> 22:15.400
<i>I do...</i>

22:15.400 --> 22:21.030
<i>Leave the "now" handed to me</i>

22:21.030 --> 22:25.740
<i>as I begin to walk in the morning</i>

22:25.740 --> 22:31.210
<i>In a world where light and dark intersect</i>

22:31.210 --> 22:37.380
<i>catharsis begins to awake</i>

22:37.380 --> 22:42.460
<i>I swore in my shaking heart</i>

22:42.460 --> 22:52.460
<i>that I won't lose anyone anymore...!</i>

22:54.270 --> 22:59.310
<i>Even if my tears flow tomorrow</i>

22:59.310 --> 23:06.050
<i>I'll run through the wind</i>

23:06.050 --> 23:11.080
<i>Release myself towards the future I selected</i>

23:11.080 --> 23:13.720
<i>to regain it</i>

23:13.720 --> 23:20.790
<i>I won't give up on my wish</i>

23:26.970 --> 23:28.940
How unpleasant...

23:28.940 --> 23:30.900
How unsightly...

23:30.900 --> 23:32.770
It's not like I'm interested...

23:32.770 --> 23:34.570
What a let down...

23:34.570 --> 23:36.510
It's not my taste...

23:36.510 --> 23:38.850
It's not my taste, but...

23:38.510 --> 23:40.970
"That Lie a Scar"

23:38.850 --> 23:40.910
That Lie a Scar.
